  "description": "Pure state-machine capability for Loop action items. Validates that a requested status change is legal given the current status and a caller-supplied transition policy, then returns the new status plus audit metadata.\n\nConfiguration defines allowed transitions and whether only the owner may perform them. The capability never mutates external state — callers apply the returned decision.\n\nCouncil/product alignment note: workflows declare a `snoozed` status for follow-through; this contract includes `snoozed` in the status enum and default transition examples so WF3/WF4 compose without a silent schema gap.",
  "emits": [],
  "event_trigger": null,
  "evidence": [],
